				105,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Implement placeholder registry for webview creation\n\nIntroduce a handler for `sky://webview/create` to park placeholder objects under their handle in the `__CEL_WEBVIEW_VIEWS_BY_HANDLE__` registry. Previously, extension-initiated panel creation from Cocoon lacked a Sky-side target, causing subsequent `webview/set-html` calls to fail silently when the registry lookup returned undefined.\n\nThe placeholder mimics the `webview` interface properties (html setter/getter), allowing HTML updates to queue as `_pendingHtml` without throwing errors before the `IWebviewWorkbenchService` is fully wired in the workbench service layer. Add conditional first-time logging for the creation event to aid diagnostics without saturating the IPC channel during boot.\n\nThis ensures robust initialization of panel-mode webviews even when the workbench accessor is not yet available, preventing silent drops of content updates during extension boot.",
			"SHA": "871cb8d522b9cb63365751205d23f78d3bfe9fd1"
		}
